1
00:00:04,710 --> 00:00:11,160
I deeply apologize, Your Highness, but...
could you please give me some time?

2
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:14,180
I want to go home, just for today.

3
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:20,400
All right.  I get it...

4
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:07,710
Eli, let's talk this over.

5
00:01:09,270 --> 00:01:14,430
<i>I should really go back
and apologize to His Highness right now...</i>

6
00:01:15,530 --> 00:01:16,430
<i>No.</i>

7
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:20,840
<i>That's what I really should have done at the time, but...</i>

8
00:01:22,610 --> 00:01:23,810
<i>I...</i>

9
00:01:25,970 --> 00:01:27,490
<i>Ran away.</i>

10
00:01:29,670 --> 00:01:36,420
<i>I was expected to learn so many things
by His Highness' side since I became his fiancÃ©e...</i>

11
00:01:39,130 --> 00:01:44,160
<i>But I was the same Bibliophile Princess
who understood nothing. </i><i></i>

12
00:01:44,810 --> 00:01:49,210
<i>No, I was the cowardly Bibliophile Princess. </i><i></i>

13
00:01:49,860 --> 00:01:55,720
As someone who will stand next to Christopher,
are you prepared for that?

14
00:01:59,950 --> 00:02:05,970
<i>I don't even know myself anymore.</i>

